  (no_connect (at 350.52 53.34) (uuid "f54fbc81-1a34-4d13-b8eb-b89d83dad87f"))
  (text "Input & protection (30 V from the bench PSU)"
    (at 16.51 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "adf5d239-5112-4ae7-a354-e1938ddfbce1")
  )
  (text "D101 bidirectional TVS (33 V stand-off): a reversed input does not conduct.\nQ101 blocks a reversed input on the precision path; D102 limits VGS to -15 V.\nF102 / VIN_PT feed the 10 A pass-through shunt (output sheet) directly.\nVIN_SENSE = VIN x 10k / 110k  (30 V -> 2.73 V)"
    (at 20.32 96.52 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b6bdde5d-2a75-477a-84f0-2ef6532b5328")
  )
  (text "Housekeeping buck 30 V -> 5 V (0.6 A)"
    (at 16.51 121.92 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e00b20e0-c4af-4f85-b3e7-3625a648be13")
  )
  (text "VOUT = 0.765 V x (1 + R104/R105) = 5.06 V.  X version (700 kHz): the Y version at 2.1 MHz\nis at its 80 ns minimum on-time for 30 V -> 5 V.  D103: Schottky catch diode (asynchronous part).\nLoads: 3.3 V LDOs, relay coil (81 mA), isolated DC/DC, sense amps: about 250 mA total."
    (at 20.32 208.28 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "d8f019cf-6903-4d15-a241-d3834fefdd61")
  )
  (text "Logic and analog rails"
    (at 217.17 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "62e34e7d-b39b-43a0-98f0-5d12d946bdf3")
  )
  (text "+3V3:  MCU, isolators, logic\n+3.3VA: INA190 ranges, MCU VDDA/VREF+, NTCs\n+5VA:  setpoint DAC (DAC80502)"
    (at 309.88 83.82 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "cad57786-6f5d-4c8d-998c-68a9220d6a0c")
  )
  (text "Op-amp supplies (VOP / VNEG)"
    (at 217.17 121.92 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "33fe50fe-a96f-43f4-8f66-877dc2b04786")
  )
  (text "Default (single supply): R108 fitted, U104 / C119 / C120 / R107 not fitted -> VNEG = GND.\nFor a true 0 V output: fit U104, C119, C120, R107 and remove R108 (VNEG = -3.2 V).\nVOP + |VNEG| must stay <= 36 V (OPA2192 / OPA192 supply limit)."
    (at 220.98 203.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9e10cdc7-4857-4922-9075-c5f0838f896f")
  )
